### ========================================
### 13. Delete Current Registration
### ========================================
DELETE http://localhost:5039/api/registration/current
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAhmed.response.body.$.token}}


### ========================================
### 14. Verify Schedule is Empty
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:5039/api/schedule/current
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAhmed.response.body.$.token}}